WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.225 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:50.585 --> 01:52.145
My Lord, General Qi is here.

5
01:54.425 --> 01:55.905
Did you find anything last night?

6
01:56.545 --> 01:58.625
I couldn't find Jin Chang, the man Wei Rao mentioned,

7
01:58.705 --> 02:00.225
in the prison last night.

8
02:00.305 --> 02:01.945
But I found relatives of the abducted girls.

9
02:02.905 --> 02:05.745
Right, and a clerk from the Court of Justice too.

10
02:05.825 --> 02:07.505
Outraged by what had happened,

11
02:07.585 --> 02:10.265
he submitted petitions for the victims and was imprisoned too.

12
02:15.305 --> 02:16.185
Can he testify?

13
02:17.225 --> 02:19.505
They cut out his tongue and severed all four limbs,

14
02:19.585 --> 02:20.945
tortured him beyond recognition.

15
02:22.345 --> 02:25.425
I only learned who he was by questioning others.

16
02:26.185 --> 02:27.865
How cruel.

17
02:28.465 --> 02:30.185
I heard bandits raided the Crown Prince's Residence.

18
02:30.265 --> 02:31.505
Was it Wei Rao…?

19
02:33.465 --> 02:34.385
It really was her?

20
02:36.265 --> 02:37.345
Heavens.

21
02:39.385 --> 02:41.305
This is bad. The Crown Prince won't let this slide.

22
02:41.905 --> 02:42.905
What are we going to do?

23
02:47.065 --> 02:49.025
My Lord, the Northern Army has searched everywhere

24
02:49.105 --> 02:50.425
and found nothing.

25
02:50.945 --> 02:52.185
Nothing at all?

26
02:53.025 --> 02:54.265
That's even stranger.

27
02:54.865 --> 02:56.665
Where could they have hidden those girls?

28
02:58.185 --> 02:59.625
Why don't you ask her yourself?

29
03:00.785 --> 03:03.025
-Right! I'll go to Zhuyu Estate now… -No need.

30
03:04.065 --> 03:05.505
She's here.

31
03:10.345 --> 03:11.185
What do you mean?

32
03:13.545 --> 03:14.905
Haven't you heard?

33
03:15.705 --> 03:16.545
Last night,

34
03:17.145 --> 03:19.705
the Northern Army searched my room and disturbed Noble Lady Wu'an.

35
03:20.385 --> 03:21.665
By noon,

36
03:22.785 --> 03:24.465
the whole capital will probably know.

37
03:24.545 --> 03:26.665
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

38
03:27.265 --> 03:28.665
You found nothing?

39
03:29.545 --> 03:31.185
We began at Your Highness's residence

40
03:31.265 --> 03:32.705
and searched all the way to the outer city.

41
03:32.785 --> 03:34.065
We even searched the Eldest Princess's residence,

42
03:34.145 --> 03:35.945
but found no sign of the wounded ringleader.

43
03:36.025 --> 03:39.145
Bandits broke into our residence and abducted concubines and maids,

44
03:39.225 --> 03:40.305
yet you caught no one.

45
03:40.385 --> 03:42.545
Did they all vanish into thin air?

46
03:42.625 --> 03:43.905
His Majesty issued a decree of grace,

47
03:43.985 --> 03:45.025
opening Guangbu Ward,

48
03:45.105 --> 03:46.505
Jingji Ward, and other areas to displaced people.

49
03:47.585 --> 03:48.985
The authorities serve congee once a day.

50
03:49.505 --> 03:52.305
But to make a living, most refugees work as day laborers or beg.

51
03:52.385 --> 03:54.585
The bandits are hiding among them. It's hard to tell them apart.

52
03:55.105 --> 03:57.425
Last night, we blocked every route from this residence out of the city,

53
03:57.505 --> 03:59.985
with checkpoints set throughout the wards and at the gates.

54
04:00.065 --> 04:02.145
But we had to withdraw our sentries at dawn

55
04:02.225 --> 04:03.185
so the refugees could seek a livelihood.

56
04:03.865 --> 04:05.745
Otherwise, unrest could've drawn His Majesty's attention,

57
04:05.825 --> 04:07.465
leading to unthinkable consequences.

58
04:07.545 --> 04:09.905
We beg Your Highness for a little more time

59
04:09.985 --> 04:11.385
to investigate discreetly.

60
04:11.905 --> 04:12.785
Investigate…

61
04:12.865 --> 04:15.705
By the time you're done, the bandits will have been long gone!

62
04:15.785 --> 04:16.905
Enough!

63
04:18.624 --> 04:20.985
-Leave me. -Your Highness…

64
04:30.465 --> 04:31.305
Don't be angry, Your Highness.

65
04:31.905 --> 04:32.785
Let me attend to you.

66
04:33.865 --> 04:35.065
Get out!

67
04:37.825 --> 04:38.745
Don't be angry, Your Highness.

68
04:39.345 --> 04:43.065
I won't come in. You must take care of yourself.

69
04:44.105 --> 04:46.585
-The bandits will surely be caught. -Useless!

70
04:47.945 --> 04:49.985
You're all useless!

71
04:51.425 --> 04:52.265
Your Highness!

72
04:55.345 --> 04:56.985
His Majesty summons you at once.

73
04:59.865 --> 05:01.145
Your Highness,

74
05:01.225 --> 05:04.945
His Majesty must have heard about the raid and must be concerned for your safety.

75
05:08.945 --> 05:09.785
Help me up.

76
05:10.465 --> 05:11.385
Yes.

77
05:11.465 --> 05:12.745
I don't want your help!

78
05:12.825 --> 05:13.905
‎RADIANT CLARITY

79
05:24.105 --> 05:24.985
SIMA GATE

80
05:25.065 --> 05:27.545
Your Majesty!

81
05:27.625 --> 05:28.985
We've been wronged!

82
05:31.705 --> 05:32.585
Your Highness.

83
05:32.665 --> 05:35.385
Who are these people wailing outside the palace entrance?

84
05:37.225 --> 05:40.105
Please show us justice!

85
05:40.185 --> 05:44.585
-Help us, Your Majesty! -Help us, Your Majesty!

86
05:47.985 --> 05:51.785
-Please, save us, Your Majesty! -Your Majesty!

87
05:51.865 --> 05:55.105
Lord Wang, last night, a carriage stopped at the palace entrance.

88
05:55.185 --> 05:58.705
When the Imperial Guards came up, many young women stepped out.

89
05:58.785 --> 06:01.785
They were said to have been abducted by someone powerful.

90
06:01.865 --> 06:05.745
They wept so bitterly that His Majesty himself was alerted.

91
06:05.825 --> 06:08.065
Nothing like this has ever happened before!

92
06:08.145 --> 06:09.465
His Majesty just summoned the Commandant of Justice

93
06:09.545 --> 06:11.465
and gave him a furious scolding.

94
06:12.145 --> 06:14.265
Then the Commandant named someone.

95
06:14.345 --> 06:16.585
-Do you know who it was? -Who? Who?

96
06:18.745 --> 06:21.425
Come on, let's go. Time for court.

97
06:21.505 --> 06:22.545
Your Majesty!

98
06:22.625 --> 06:27.345
Give us justice, Your Majesty!

99
06:29.505 --> 06:32.105
Give us justice!

100
06:32.185 --> 06:34.625
Justice, Your Majesty!

101
06:34.705 --> 06:36.105
-Hurry. -Okay.

102
06:36.185 --> 06:38.265
‎SIMA GATE

103
06:39.945 --> 06:41.145
‎RED-AND-BLACK PAINTED WOODWORK

104
06:41.225 --> 06:42.065
Don't be afraid.

105
06:42.665 --> 06:44.265
The Northern Army is busy hunting bandits.

106
06:44.345 --> 06:46.425
The Crown Prince's residence and his other estate are both on fire.

107
06:46.505 --> 06:48.065
His household is too busy saving itself.

108
06:48.665 --> 06:50.145
Besides, so what if they do catch up?

109
06:50.225 --> 06:52.545
You're not slaves, and you've committed no crime.

110
06:52.625 --> 06:53.705
They have no grounds to arrest you.

111
06:53.785 --> 06:56.865
Why isn't the carriage heading out of the city?

112
06:56.945 --> 06:58.985
Where are we going to hide?

113
06:59.505 --> 07:02.505
If my family knows I escaped from the Crown Prince's residence,

114
07:02.585 --> 07:03.745
they wouldn't dare to keep me.

115
07:03.825 --> 07:07.345
To get home safely, you need only remember one thing.

116
07:07.865 --> 07:10.985
When I take you to our destination, just cry.

117
07:11.065 --> 07:12.225
Cry out loud.

118
07:12.305 --> 07:13.825
The louder, the better.

119
07:14.585 --> 07:15.585
Cry?

120
07:21.985 --> 07:23.625
Crying in front of the person hurting you

121
07:24.225 --> 07:26.065
only adds to his pleasure in bullying the weak.

122
07:27.545 --> 07:29.025
But if you cry in the right place,

123
07:29.705 --> 07:31.905
loudly enough for the Emperor and the whole world to hear,

124
07:31.985 --> 07:34.865
and strike fear into the man behind it all,

125
07:34.945 --> 07:38.665
will he still risk universal condemnation and pursue you?

126
07:38.745 --> 07:39.785
Even if he wants revenge,

127
07:40.785 --> 07:44.625
he'll have to consider how secure his own position is.

128
07:49.145 --> 07:52.185
If one day the Crown Prince takes the throne,

129
07:52.785 --> 07:55.105
he'll have his pick of all the women in the realm.

130
07:55.705 --> 07:57.945
Who will care whether those women were willing?

131
07:58.905 --> 08:02.185
The law applies to commoners,

132
08:03.065 --> 08:05.025
not princes.

133
08:13.785 --> 08:15.665
XUANSHI PALACE

134
08:15.745 --> 08:16.905
Attendant Zheng,

135
08:18.385 --> 08:21.185
please plead my case before Father.

136
08:22.025 --> 08:23.505
I've been falsely accused.

137
08:23.585 --> 08:24.425
Your Highness,

138
08:24.505 --> 08:28.305
those women wept loudly outside the palace and alerted His Majesty.

139
08:28.385 --> 08:30.025
His Majesty ordered me to ask them,

140
08:30.105 --> 08:32.225
and certain unseemly words came to light.

141
08:32.305 --> 08:34.225
His Majesty was furious.

142
08:34.305 --> 08:37.144
Anyone who tried to send word to your household

143
08:37.225 --> 08:38.945
was given 80 strokes of the rod.

144
08:39.024 --> 08:41.024
By merely ordering you to kneel here,

145
08:41.105 --> 08:44.545
His Majesty has shown exceptional mercy because you are his own flesh and blood.

146
08:47.425 --> 08:49.065
He's committed so many crimes.

147
08:49.145 --> 08:50.745
Everyone else has been punished,

148
08:51.345 --> 08:54.065
yet he, the chief culprit, need only kneel here.

149
08:54.665 --> 08:58.025
It's so unfair to the girls whose families he destroyed.

150
08:59.225 --> 09:01.905
In affairs of state, the Crown Prince has made no major mistakes.

151
09:02.785 --> 09:04.505
Even if he's gone a bit too far with women,

152
09:04.585 --> 09:08.145
Father will give him a light punishment and let it go.

153
09:08.745 --> 09:10.745
After all, he's the son Father values the most.

154
09:14.625 --> 09:16.945
Father has already lost one son.

155
09:17.025 --> 09:18.425
How could he bear to lose the Crown Prince too?

156
09:20.345 --> 09:21.705
-Your Highness! -Oh no.

157
09:21.785 --> 09:22.625
The Crown Prince can't hold out any longer.

158
09:22.705 --> 09:24.425
-I'll go check on him! -What's it to you?

159
09:26.385 --> 09:27.465
Shou!

160
09:29.745 --> 09:30.785
Your Highness…

161
09:32.505 --> 09:34.425
Shou. Shou.

162
09:35.505 --> 09:37.865
I'll plead with Father on your behalf. Wait here.

163
09:40.665 --> 09:41.945
You're a good brother.

164
09:43.585 --> 09:45.145
I'll remember this favor.

165
09:45.225 --> 09:47.385
We're brothers. No need for thanks.

166
09:47.465 --> 09:48.945
Take good care of the Crown Prince.

167
09:49.025 --> 09:49.865
Yes.

168
09:58.225 --> 09:59.865
Sentimental fool.

169
10:00.705 --> 10:03.625
Wei Rao, there are too many eyes watching in the capital.

170
10:03.705 --> 10:05.425
It'll be hard for you to recover here.

171
10:06.105 --> 10:08.185
I have a hot spring villa in Yongzhou.

172
10:08.265 --> 10:09.745
It's beautiful and good for healing.

173
10:10.505 --> 10:12.185
Even if the Crown Prince fears public criticism

174
10:12.265 --> 10:13.625
and dares not search openly,

175
10:13.705 --> 10:15.345
you should still lie low somewhere else.

176
10:15.425 --> 10:17.025
He's the heir to the throne, after all.

177
10:17.785 --> 10:20.025
So long as His Majesty doesn't depose him,

178
10:21.545 --> 10:22.545
you must stay on your guard.

179
10:23.585 --> 10:24.425
You…

180
10:26.785 --> 10:29.785
Wei Rao, I'll stay with you there for a while.

181
10:29.865 --> 10:31.425
Once things settle down, you may return to the capital.

182
10:32.025 --> 10:34.065
-What do you say? -The carriage is ready.

183
10:35.025 --> 10:36.065
Time to leave.

184
10:38.505 --> 10:39.425
I'll escort you back to the estate.

185
10:39.505 --> 10:41.945
Noble Lady Wu'an spends the night at the Duke's Residence,

186
10:42.025 --> 10:43.585
then General Qi escorts her home the next day.

187
10:44.185 --> 10:46.065
That would set off all sorts of rumors.

188
10:47.625 --> 10:49.465
You'd better spare her your attentions.

189
10:50.185 --> 10:51.785
If you truly had her interests at heart,

190
10:51.865 --> 10:54.105
why bring her here while she was unconscious?

191
10:54.185 --> 10:55.825
You even kept her in your own room

192
10:56.425 --> 10:58.065
and let so many people see her here.

193
10:58.145 --> 11:00.305
What, did you think Wei Rao's reputation was too spotless?

194
11:01.065 --> 11:02.385
This had to be kept secret.

195
11:03.185 --> 11:05.105
My residence was the closest to the Crown Prince's.

196
11:05.185 --> 11:06.025
Did you expect me

197
11:11.625 --> 11:12.785
to take the injured outside the city?

198
11:13.625 --> 11:15.945
You can spare me that righteous act of yours.

199
11:16.745 --> 11:18.705
You planned this with an ulterior motive.

200
11:19.545 --> 11:20.865
Your intentions were never honorable.

201
11:23.025 --> 11:24.225
You two can carry on arguing.

202
11:25.185 --> 11:26.265
I'm going home.

203
11:36.065 --> 11:37.145
Thank you for your help, Lord Lu.

204
11:40.025 --> 11:40.865
Attendants!

205
11:58.385 --> 12:00.785
Don't think your careful planning lets you anticipate everything.

206
12:01.385 --> 12:03.185
She already moved out of your residence.

207
12:04.425 --> 12:05.865
She won't marry you again.

208
12:06.505 --> 12:09.265
I've made my feelings for Wei Rao clear.

209
12:09.345 --> 12:11.305
I won't bring it up again and annoy her.

210
12:13.505 --> 12:16.585
You shouldn't keep pressuring or pestering her either.

211
12:18.785 --> 12:20.345
Let her recover in peace.

212
12:21.065 --> 12:23.705
I hope you mean what you say.

213
12:46.065 --> 12:46.985
It was her.

214
12:48.025 --> 12:49.385
It must be her.

215
12:56.185 --> 12:59.025
Your Highness, the Crown Prince has returned from the palace.

216
13:18.985 --> 13:20.305
Your Highness.

217
13:27.065 --> 13:28.465
Didn't you go to the palace?

218
13:28.545 --> 13:30.665
How did you end up in this state?

219
13:32.305 --> 13:33.745
Have they caught anyone?

220
13:35.025 --> 13:36.065
Not yet.

221
13:39.825 --> 13:43.065
Your Highness, I had no solid evidence,

222
13:43.145 --> 13:45.025
so I didn't want to make unfounded accusations.

223
13:45.745 --> 13:46.905
But the more I think about it,

224
13:48.505 --> 13:49.985
the more suspicious someone seems.

225
13:51.225 --> 13:52.065
Who?

226
13:52.145 --> 13:56.185
There was a wild sparrow locked out back. Noble Lady Wu'an was her foster sister.

227
13:57.185 --> 13:58.585
She asked for the girl but failed.

228
13:58.665 --> 13:59.705
That must have driven her to it.

229
14:00.745 --> 14:05.745
I suspect she took the opportunity to free the other women as well.

230
14:06.345 --> 14:07.785
Absurd.

231
14:08.545 --> 14:11.945
Could one woman cause such havoc,

232
14:12.545 --> 14:14.785
then vanish without a trace despite a citywide search?

233
14:15.385 --> 14:16.385
But, Your Highness…

234
14:16.465 --> 14:18.065
Women talk such foolish nonsense!

235
14:18.145 --> 14:19.625
I should never have believed you!

236
14:19.705 --> 14:21.185
Please calm down, Your Highness.

237
14:21.705 --> 14:23.585
I let my concern for you cloud my judgment and jumped to conclusions.

238
14:27.105 --> 14:28.185
For now, you must focus

239
14:29.545 --> 14:31.025
on your recovery.

240
14:31.825 --> 14:33.145
Catching the culprit

241
14:33.665 --> 14:35.905
-can wait until you get well. -Get out!

242
14:37.425 --> 14:38.345
Your Highness.

243
14:46.785 --> 14:47.625
Your Highness…

244
14:52.545 --> 14:53.785
I'll take my leave.

245
14:56.385 --> 14:58.265
UPHOLD VIRTUE AND HONOR TRADITION

246
15:06.945 --> 15:08.465
What's wrong with His Highness?

247
15:08.545 --> 15:10.265
Why is he so angry with you?

248
15:11.025 --> 15:12.145
Something's wrong.

249
15:12.945 --> 15:15.505
Something must have happened that they're keeping from me.

250
15:17.305 --> 15:18.425
Have the carriage prepared.

251
15:18.505 --> 15:21.905
I'll go to Zhuyu Estate myself and find out.

252
15:21.985 --> 15:24.225
ZHUYU ESTATE

253
15:40.985 --> 15:42.705
Your Ladyship, the Crown Princess is here.

254
15:49.705 --> 15:52.505
Your Ladyship, what should we do with Hongxian?

255
15:53.025 --> 15:54.865
I'll take her somewhere to hide.

256
15:54.945 --> 15:56.065
Can she hide for the rest of her life?

257
15:59.265 --> 16:00.185
Come here.

258
16:02.585 --> 16:03.905
Here's what we'll do.

259
16:23.945 --> 16:26.785
I should have prepared a proper welcome for such an honored guest.

260
16:27.385 --> 16:30.145
But Your Highness gave me no notice,

261
16:30.665 --> 16:31.865
so I'm afraid I've been discourteous.

262
16:33.145 --> 16:33.985
Leave us.

263
16:47.265 --> 16:48.265
I know it was you.

264
16:48.945 --> 16:51.465
Me? What have I done?

265
16:52.065 --> 16:56.065
When you and your Lady Li drove my mother to hang herself,

266
16:56.145 --> 16:57.145
I forgave you both

267
16:57.745 --> 17:01.185
because I knew the greater good had to come first.

268
17:02.465 --> 17:04.505
And how have you repaid me?

269
17:04.585 --> 17:06.625
You acted so recklessly.

270
17:06.704 --> 17:08.585
Did you ever spare a thought for the Wei family?

271
17:13.265 --> 17:14.265
Come out.

272
17:35.745 --> 17:37.945
Hongxian, pour Her Highness some tea.

273
17:40.985 --> 17:42.825
I haven't formally introduced her to Your Highness.

274
17:44.305 --> 17:45.185
This is my sister,

275
17:46.825 --> 17:47.865
Hongxian.

276
17:56.265 --> 17:57.265
Wei Rao!

277
17:58.385 --> 18:00.585
How dare you? How could you?

278
18:01.185 --> 18:03.545
We're bound by blood and family.

279
18:03.625 --> 18:05.865
We should be on the same side, supporting each other.

280
18:06.425 --> 18:08.585
Yet for someone so lowly, you…

281
18:08.665 --> 18:10.785
Do people of lowly birth deserve to die?

282
18:17.985 --> 18:21.265
Big fish swallow little fish, and little fish eat shrimp.

283
18:21.785 --> 18:23.265
The strong devour the weak.

284
18:24.225 --> 18:25.745
That's the way of the world.

285
18:27.425 --> 18:28.705
But for her sake,

286
18:29.505 --> 18:31.705
you defied the Crown Prince. Such an unforgivable crime.

287
18:32.465 --> 18:34.065
How could you be so foolish?

288
18:34.865 --> 18:37.225
The butcher at the market is lowly.

289
18:37.825 --> 18:38.985
When he sees a noble,

290
18:39.705 --> 18:42.145
he must crawl on his hands and knees and kowtow repeatedly.

291
18:43.825 --> 18:45.145
But he has a knife in his hand.

292
18:45.865 --> 18:48.025
Push him to the limit,

293
18:48.905 --> 18:52.225
and who cares about defying superiors or offending the highborn?

294
18:58.425 --> 18:59.865
You lords of privilege,

295
19:01.145 --> 19:02.945
nothing but raw meat upon the chopping block.

296
19:03.905 --> 19:05.385
What's there to fear?

297
19:06.905 --> 19:09.065
Hongxian, pour another cup.

298
19:41.425 --> 19:43.105
His Highness, the Crown Prince,

299
19:43.945 --> 19:46.585
will one day ascend the throne, with the whole realm at his feet.

300
19:47.585 --> 19:48.465
Wei Rao,

301
19:49.145 --> 19:52.985
you'll regret today's arrogance when it's too late.

302
19:56.025 --> 19:57.385
What are you laughing at?

303
19:58.185 --> 19:59.905
I'm scared.

304
20:01.585 --> 20:03.505
So scared I'm trembling.

305
20:04.745 --> 20:06.865
Let him become Emperor first.

306
20:07.465 --> 20:08.945
Then he can come and take my head.

307
20:16.305 --> 20:19.425
This matter is far from over.

308
20:20.505 --> 20:24.105
Since we belong to the same clan, I won't expose you publicly.

309
20:25.345 --> 20:26.585
You'd better watch yourself.

310
20:27.825 --> 20:30.025
You're just afraid I'll implicate you and cost you

311
20:30.105 --> 20:31.545
the Crown Prince's favor, aren't you?

312
20:34.905 --> 20:36.145
After all,

313
20:39.225 --> 20:41.185
-we both bear the surname Wei. -You…!

314
20:49.585 --> 20:50.785
My sister

315
20:52.225 --> 20:54.105
was abducted by bandits.

316
20:55.385 --> 20:56.825
Fortunately, Heaven took pity on her.

317
20:57.425 --> 21:00.305
Their hideout caught fire, and she escaped with her life.

318
21:01.385 --> 21:03.465
A kind soul then brought her to my estate.

319
21:05.425 --> 21:09.065
Your Highness, be sure to remember that.

320
21:11.785 --> 21:13.025
Don't go telling people otherwise.

321
21:15.985 --> 21:17.625
You can see yourself out.

322
21:41.345 --> 21:43.505
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.

323
21:45.865 --> 21:46.985
Do you remember

324
21:48.225 --> 21:51.545
how we stabbed the Crown Prince before we left?

325
22:11.545 --> 22:12.505
What I did

326
22:14.705 --> 22:15.985
was not solely to avenge you.

327
22:18.905 --> 22:21.345
When I looked at him, I suddenly thought

328
22:22.705 --> 22:26.385
how can a country be entrusted to someone like him?

329
22:28.145 --> 22:31.185
How can the people accept someone so depraved as their ruler?

330
22:32.785 --> 22:33.825
No, it can't happen.

331
22:35.425 --> 22:36.785
Absolutely not.

332
22:41.465 --> 22:42.785
So don't be afraid.

333
22:43.945 --> 22:46.105
With such leverage over the Crown Prince,

334
22:46.745 --> 22:49.625
he will be a hundred, a thousand times more fearful than we.

335
22:50.785 --> 22:54.585
He has far more reason to fear the matter becoming known to the world.

336
22:57.825 --> 22:58.865
If I were him,

337
23:00.225 --> 23:04.425
I'd make everyone in his household keep their mouths tightly shut.

338
23:05.385 --> 23:07.305
After all, the Emperor still has three sons.

339
23:07.905 --> 23:09.745
But the Crown Prince will never have one.

340
23:21.145 --> 23:22.825
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

341
23:22.905 --> 23:24.065
What?

342
23:24.145 --> 23:25.745
Marry Noble Lady Wu'an again?

343
23:26.585 --> 23:29.505
Yes. That's exactly what I intend.

344
23:30.025 --> 23:31.945
Mother, as the saying goes,

345
23:32.025 --> 23:34.385
"A broken bond is hard to mend, and spilled water can't be recovered."

346
23:34.465 --> 23:37.465
Both families are noble and respectable.

347
23:38.305 --> 23:41.865
First they demand a divorce, then they want to marry again.

348
23:41.945 --> 23:43.905
Won't that make us look like a joke?

349
23:44.825 --> 23:47.825
And you, Wanniang, should keep your son in line.

350
23:47.905 --> 23:50.305
Marriage is not something to take lightly.

351
23:50.385 --> 23:53.265
If Rao is willing to be my daughter-in-law again,

352
23:53.345 --> 23:56.225
I'd be delighted. Why should I stop them?

353
23:56.305 --> 23:58.265
You're being foolish.

354
23:58.345 --> 24:00.425
Wei Rao is no longer that demure young lady.

355
24:01.105 --> 24:05.025
I hear Zhuyu Estate has a private army with strong men and fine horses.

356
24:05.105 --> 24:07.265
One word from her, and they all obey. Such power!

357
24:07.345 --> 24:08.905
The Crown Prince and Prince Fu vie to win her over.

358
24:08.985 --> 24:11.025
Princes and noblemen flock to her.

359
24:11.105 --> 24:13.585
If you bring such an exalted figure into our household,

360
24:13.665 --> 24:15.345
aren't you asking for misery?

361
24:16.025 --> 24:17.505
Stop making veiled accusations.

362
24:18.065 --> 24:19.945
She shelters refugees, saves countless lives.

363
24:20.545 --> 24:23.905
Grateful for her kindness, the people even built her a living shrine.

364
24:23.985 --> 24:25.425
What extraordinary merit this is!

365
24:25.505 --> 24:27.545
Her name will go down in history.

366
24:28.185 --> 24:31.185
If such a woman joins the Lu family, we'll share in that honor.

367
24:32.705 --> 24:34.865
I'm only thinking of what's best for our family.

368
24:36.225 --> 24:38.425
She keeps a male lover at that estate.

369
24:38.505 --> 24:40.225
Did you know that?

370
24:40.305 --> 24:41.905
Utter nonsense!

371
24:42.625 --> 24:45.705
All these malicious rumors are deliberate slander from noble families

372
24:45.785 --> 24:46.865
for land and profit.

373
24:47.585 --> 24:49.305
Why don't you visit Zhuyu Estate yourself?

374
24:49.385 --> 24:53.065
Every decent houses have been torn down for granaries and fields.

375
24:54.065 --> 24:55.625
It is all about saving lives.

376
24:56.305 --> 24:59.945
Those who slander her behind her back are the real bandits and harlots.

377
25:00.625 --> 25:01.625
What did you say?

378
25:03.465 --> 25:06.385
-Who are you calling bandits and harlots? -How dare you!

379
25:06.465 --> 25:07.945
I'm talking about someone insolent!

380
25:08.025 --> 25:08.905
Then it's you!

381
25:08.985 --> 25:10.185
-Enough. -Say no more.

382
25:10.265 --> 25:11.425
-Enough. -Say no more.

383
25:11.505 --> 25:13.145
-I'm talking about you! -Don't argue.

384
25:13.225 --> 25:14.065
Don't upset Mother.

385
25:14.145 --> 25:15.265
-Be quiet! -It is you!

386
25:15.345 --> 25:17.225
-All of you, be quiet! -Yes, you!

387
25:17.305 --> 25:18.505
Say no more.

388
25:18.585 --> 25:20.465
This is disgraceful!

389
25:21.625 --> 25:22.465
Mother,

390
25:23.425 --> 25:27.185
the Lu family has always been loyal, brave, and upright.

391
25:27.265 --> 25:30.585
A woman so fond of public attention and so brazen in her conduct

392
25:30.665 --> 25:33.945
really isn't fit to join our family.

393
25:35.985 --> 25:39.265
Aunts, take such an interest in my marriage?

394
25:40.785 --> 25:42.425
Why not ask what I think first?

395
25:46.105 --> 25:47.465
You're just in time.

396
25:47.545 --> 25:49.425
We're discussing your marriage.

397
25:49.505 --> 25:51.425
You ought to hear what we have to say.

398
25:52.905 --> 25:54.585
Aunts, you were just saying

399
25:54.665 --> 25:56.345
someone's spreading lies to smearHer Ladyship.

400
25:57.025 --> 25:58.585
Don't they value their necks?

401
25:58.665 --> 26:02.905
I'd like to know who had the nerve to do that.

402
26:04.425 --> 26:06.345
They're only rumors from the streets.

403
26:06.425 --> 26:07.785
You can't take them seriously.

404
26:07.865 --> 26:09.545
We were only making conversation.

405
26:10.385 --> 26:11.905
Zhuyu Estate houses more than refugees,

406
26:12.585 --> 26:14.185
but also wandering warriors.

407
26:14.705 --> 26:17.265
Wagging tongues bring calamity upon oneself.

408
26:17.345 --> 26:18.425
Arrows from the shadows have no eyes.

409
26:18.505 --> 26:21.625
Aunts, you'd do well to remember that.

410
26:22.225 --> 26:24.385
We're your elders.

411
26:25.465 --> 26:27.465
How can you speak to us like that?

412
26:27.545 --> 26:30.905
All the more reason to conduct yourselves properly.

413
26:31.505 --> 26:33.825
Lu Zhuo is kindly giving you a warning.

414
26:33.905 --> 26:37.185
You two, watch your mouths.

415
26:38.065 --> 26:40.465
Yes, Mother. You're right to reprimand us.

416
26:41.865 --> 26:42.745
Mother,

417
26:42.825 --> 26:45.105
Lu Ya's old injury still hasn't healed,

418
26:45.185 --> 26:47.425
yet he's insisting on practicing martial arts again.

419
26:47.505 --> 26:49.105
I must keep an eye on him.

420
26:49.185 --> 26:50.905
Please forgive me, Mother.

421
26:50.985 --> 26:53.225
I won't be able to stay and attend to you.

422
27:03.585 --> 27:05.225
I'll go and check on Lu Ya too.

423
27:09.025 --> 27:11.145
Zhuo, pay them no mind.

424
27:12.425 --> 27:16.505
Talk it over with Wei Rao and decide when to hold the wedding.

425
27:18.065 --> 27:19.905
Who said I was going to marry Wei Rao?

426
27:22.425 --> 27:25.545
The Northern Army found her in your room,

427
27:25.625 --> 27:27.745
and the whole capital is gossiping about it.

428
27:27.825 --> 27:28.905
If you don't marry her,

429
27:28.985 --> 27:31.225
people will point fingers at us behind our backs.

430
27:31.305 --> 27:32.625
Grandmother,

431
27:33.665 --> 27:35.465
please let me decide for myself.

432
27:35.545 --> 27:37.305
Don't bring this up again.

433
27:37.905 --> 27:40.545
Thank you for granting my wish. I'll take my leave.

434
27:41.745 --> 27:43.185
I haven't granted anything!

435
27:43.705 --> 27:44.625
You may have no shame,

436
27:44.705 --> 27:46.705
-but we have a reputation to uphold! -Mother.

437
27:46.785 --> 27:48.545
How am I supposed to face other people now?

438
27:48.625 --> 27:50.625
-You! Come back here! Come back! -Mother.

439
27:50.705 --> 27:52.705
-You owe me an explanation! -Calm down.

440
27:52.785 --> 27:54.385
-You…! -Calm down, Mother.

441
27:54.465 --> 27:56.265
QIWU COURT

442
27:57.945 --> 28:00.705
The physician says Hongxian's throat was badly burned.

443
28:01.345 --> 28:03.905
Even after treatment, her voice will never be the same.

444
28:08.065 --> 28:08.905
I see.

445
28:09.505 --> 28:10.945
Runsheng keeps demanding to see you.

446
28:12.065 --> 28:13.905
He's a hopeless gambler who refuses to change.

447
28:14.705 --> 28:16.305
Give him one bowl of plain congee a day

448
28:16.385 --> 28:18.145
and send him to work on wasteland.

449
28:18.225 --> 28:19.945
If he dares slack off, string him up and beat him.

450
28:21.585 --> 28:22.745
Yes.

451
28:22.825 --> 28:24.705
AS THE SUN RISES

452
28:32.265 --> 28:34.105
Your Ladyship, Cheng requests an audience.

453
28:35.105 --> 28:36.265
Which Cheng?

454
28:36.345 --> 28:38.105
The man you brought back from the Crown Prince's Residence.

455
28:41.865 --> 28:42.785
Let him in.

456
28:45.065 --> 28:47.305
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

457
28:51.785 --> 28:52.985
Your Ladyship had me learn bookkeeping.

458
28:53.585 --> 28:56.025
The teachers taught me with great patience.

459
28:56.105 --> 28:57.665
They said I had a talent for it and learned quickly.

460
28:58.705 --> 29:00.545
I wanted to repay your great kindness.

461
29:01.145 --> 29:04.185
After much thought, I improved the bookkeeping method.

462
29:04.265 --> 29:06.105
I've simplified it so that income and expenses

463
29:06.185 --> 29:07.785
need only be reported every ten days.

464
29:07.865 --> 29:09.585
It'll be easier for Your Ladyship to review.

465
29:10.265 --> 29:11.705
One of the teachers asked me to bring this ledger

466
29:11.785 --> 29:12.625
for Your Ladyship to check.

467
29:13.585 --> 29:14.425
Let me see it.

468
29:19.105 --> 29:22.065
With this method, Your Ladyship, calculating profit and loss

469
29:22.145 --> 29:24.065
is much simpler.

470
29:26.545 --> 29:28.345
DAILY RECORD OF INCOME AND EXPENDITURES

471
29:42.385 --> 29:43.785
Grandmother, you're here.

472
29:44.385 --> 29:45.745
Why wasn't I told?

473
29:46.265 --> 29:47.665
I told them not to announce me.

474
29:52.025 --> 29:54.465
I wanted to see for myself

475
29:54.545 --> 29:56.985
whether you're really hiding a mianshou here.

476
29:58.025 --> 29:59.145
Mianshou?

477
30:00.745 --> 30:03.185
Your Ladyship. Your Ladyship.

478
30:03.265 --> 30:05.065
That means a male lover.

479
30:06.265 --> 30:08.625
-What? -A male lover.

480
30:11.265 --> 30:13.185
Since when have I kept a male lover?

481
30:13.265 --> 30:14.825
Where would I find the money for that?

482
30:15.425 --> 30:16.785
He may not be one now,

483
30:18.585 --> 30:21.345
but who knows what the future holds?

484
30:21.945 --> 30:24.585
Men who live off their looks can't be trusted.

485
30:24.665 --> 30:27.505
I'm worried you'll be blinded by a handsome face,

486
30:27.585 --> 30:29.825
so I've come to warn you.

487
30:29.905 --> 30:32.345
-Governess Sun. -Yes.

488
30:38.345 --> 30:39.225
Set them down.

489
30:43.905 --> 30:45.385
What is this for, Grandmother?

490
30:46.265 --> 30:48.625
Lord Huo Jue was back with his caravan yesterday.

491
30:48.705 --> 30:50.785
He heard Your Ladyship would soon be marrying

492
30:50.865 --> 30:52.865
and feared you'd have no one around,

493
30:52.945 --> 30:55.105
so he prepared some gifts for you in advance.

494
30:55.705 --> 30:56.585
Gifts?

495
30:57.465 --> 30:58.705
For whom?

496
31:00.465 --> 31:02.065
Pretending not to know?

497
31:02.145 --> 31:04.625
The Duke of Ying's household, of course.

498
31:05.225 --> 31:06.945
You have only two dates to choose from:

499
31:07.545 --> 31:11.185
the eighth or the sixteenth day of the second month.

500
31:11.785 --> 31:13.385
Those are the only two auspicious dates.

501
31:13.465 --> 31:14.665
Choose one.

502
31:20.385 --> 31:23.305
I just heard this gentleman was good with figures.

503
31:23.945 --> 31:27.265
Lord Huo's caravan could use someone with his talent.

504
31:29.265 --> 31:30.785
I only wish to serve Your Ladyship.

505
31:31.505 --> 31:34.025
Grandmother, there's no rush.

506
31:34.105 --> 31:35.025
Please let me think it over.

507
31:39.145 --> 31:42.105
Your Ladyship, Lord Lu earned his power and standing

508
31:42.185 --> 31:44.105
by risking his life on the battlefield.

509
31:44.185 --> 31:46.025
Now people call him heartless,

510
31:46.105 --> 31:47.465
and the censors accuse him of immoral conduct.

511
31:48.065 --> 31:50.265
If you keep hesitating,

512
31:50.345 --> 31:53.145
the Lu family's honor, built over a century, may be ruined.

513
31:53.865 --> 31:55.065
Is it that serious?

514
31:55.145 --> 31:56.825
It's settled. Take him away.

515
31:56.905 --> 31:58.345
-Attendants! -Your Ladyship!

516
31:59.345 --> 32:00.425
Your Ladyship, save me!

517
32:01.225 --> 32:03.745
Your Ladyship! Save me!

518
32:04.625 --> 32:07.625
There's no future in living off a woman's favor.

519
32:07.705 --> 32:11.065
With the caravan, he'll learn real skills.

520
32:16.585 --> 32:17.625
Grandmother,

521
32:19.185 --> 32:23.265
I was forced into my first marriage. I had no choice.

522
32:23.945 --> 32:27.345
May I decide for myself the second time?

523
32:29.465 --> 32:32.705
Very well. But you have only seven days.

524
32:33.305 --> 32:35.745
Decide whether you'll marry him or not in seven days.

525
32:36.825 --> 32:37.665
I will.

526
32:41.145 --> 32:43.185
Your Ladyship, Lady Xie requests an audience.

527
32:44.185 --> 32:45.345
Xie Hualou?

528
32:47.025 --> 32:50.745
Your Ladyship, I know I was presumptuous today.

529
32:50.825 --> 32:52.985
Thank you for agreeing to hear me out.

530
32:53.505 --> 32:54.705
What brings you here, Lady Xie?

531
32:56.625 --> 32:58.025
My family has ordered me

532
32:58.905 --> 33:00.225
to marry Prince Fu.

533
33:01.065 --> 33:03.905
He has two secondary consorts, countless concubines,

534
33:03.985 --> 33:05.305
and children by his concubines.

535
33:05.385 --> 33:07.025
I don't want this marriage.

536
33:07.105 --> 33:10.985
But even when I refused food in protest, Grandfather wouldn't relent.

537
33:11.065 --> 33:14.305
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

538
33:14.385 --> 33:15.505
Why come to me?

539
33:16.265 --> 33:19.105
I thought if I followed all the rules expected of a young lady

540
33:19.705 --> 33:21.065
and did as I was told,

541
33:21.585 --> 33:24.425
they'd at least find me a good husband.

542
33:24.505 --> 33:27.105
I never imagined it would come to this.

543
33:28.705 --> 33:31.625
Somehow, I felt compelled to come and see you.

544
33:32.305 --> 33:34.025
To see how a woman who defies all convention,

545
33:34.105 --> 33:36.825
who is wicked and selfish, is living these days?

546
33:38.385 --> 33:39.785
Now you've seen it.

547
33:40.385 --> 33:41.545
You can leave satisfied.

548
33:45.825 --> 33:46.985
Your Ladyship!

549
33:48.385 --> 33:52.345
Do you remember my personal maid, Pingxiang?

550
33:53.425 --> 33:54.785
After she was carried home that day,

551
33:55.385 --> 33:57.625
Grandfather blamed her for encouraging me to cause trouble

552
33:57.705 --> 33:58.985
and had her beaten to death.

553
34:00.145 --> 34:02.465
I've kept this to myself all this time.

554
34:03.265 --> 34:04.705
If I threw caution to the wind

555
34:05.225 --> 34:08.185
and exposed you as the one responsible back then,

556
34:09.304 --> 34:12.545
do you think you'd still have such a good reputation?

557
34:12.625 --> 34:15.784
She's blaming me for Jundai's wrongdoing.

558
34:17.865 --> 34:20.905
That's your family's affair. It has nothing to do with me.

559
34:22.185 --> 34:25.225
If you insist on telling everyone, that's your choice.

560
34:26.065 --> 34:28.385
-Please leave. -Your Ladyship!

561
34:29.385 --> 34:31.425
I didn't bring up the past to threaten you.

562
34:31.505 --> 34:35.185
I came to beg you to help me.

563
34:35.784 --> 34:37.344
What are you doing? Get up.

564
34:38.585 --> 34:40.145
After your divorce,

565
34:40.225 --> 34:42.304
the Duke of Ying proposed a marriage with my family,

566
34:43.065 --> 34:45.344
but Lu Zhuo refused.

567
34:45.425 --> 34:48.545
There are countless men in this world who would ask for your hand.

568
34:48.625 --> 34:50.945
You have no shortage of suitors besides Lord Lu.

569
34:51.025 --> 34:52.505
But in all the world,

570
34:52.585 --> 34:54.665
the only man who can save me from Prince Fu

571
34:56.304 --> 34:57.585
is Lu Zhuo.

572
34:59.265 --> 35:01.425
All I ask is that you take pity on me.

573
35:02.425 --> 35:04.185
If you tell him you won't marry him,

574
35:04.785 --> 35:07.345
Lu Zhuo will give up and marry me.

575
35:12.625 --> 35:13.625
Your Ladyship,

576
35:14.145 --> 35:15.505
I'm not trying to compete with you.

577
35:16.545 --> 35:18.425
I don't want to marry Prince Fu.

578
35:18.505 --> 35:20.625
I don't want to spend my life in hell.

579
35:21.785 --> 35:22.785
So I'm begging you.

580
35:22.865 --> 35:26.065
Help me. Please help me.

581
35:28.185 --> 35:29.985
If your two families truly want this marriage,

582
35:30.825 --> 35:32.385
what could an outsider like me do about it?

583
35:33.465 --> 35:35.025
You overestimate me.

584
35:35.625 --> 35:38.145
If you want help, ask Lu Zhuo.

585
35:39.265 --> 35:41.345
But I'm a young lady confined to the inner chambers.

586
35:41.425 --> 35:43.985
I have no proper reason to request an audience with him.

587
35:44.065 --> 35:46.145
What else can I do?

588
35:49.305 --> 35:51.265
So you came to Zhuyu Estate today

589
35:53.225 --> 35:54.305
to see him?

590
35:55.505 --> 35:57.545
Please show me kindness, Your Ladyship,

591
35:59.105 --> 36:00.945
and let me see him.

592
36:03.225 --> 36:05.265
I've long since opened Mount Yaowang to the public.

593
36:06.105 --> 36:07.745
Anyone is free to fish and hunt here.

594
36:08.745 --> 36:11.185
You can wait for him if you wish.

595
36:13.825 --> 36:16.265
Noble Lady Wu'an, thank you.

596
36:16.825 --> 36:23.025
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

597
36:28.145 --> 36:30.345
Wei Rao owes everything to her scheming seductive mother.

598
36:30.425 --> 36:32.305
Now she thinks she can lord it over everyone.

599
36:32.385 --> 36:33.225
CAISHU HALL

600
36:33.305 --> 36:35.905
You lowered yourself to ask for help, yet she acted so arrogantly!

601
36:37.305 --> 36:39.465
We have no choice under the circumstances.

602
36:40.145 --> 36:43.425
Lord Lu once avoided her like the plague.

603
36:43.505 --> 36:45.265
Hasn't he also changed his attitude now?

604
36:46.025 --> 36:49.025
What does Wei Rao have that I don't?

605
36:49.865 --> 36:52.185
With patience and persistence,

606
36:53.065 --> 36:55.305
I'll make him see

607
36:55.385 --> 36:58.665
who deserves to be the future mistress of the Duke's household.

608
37:01.425 --> 37:02.345
Your Ladyship.

609
37:02.425 --> 37:03.745
‎Be careful.

610
37:12.585 --> 37:15.465
Go. Follow Xie Hualou.

611
37:16.785 --> 37:17.625
Yes.

612
37:50.905 --> 37:53.145
TRIUMPH TAVERN

613
37:56.345 --> 37:58.065
Fortunately, I was prepared.

614
37:58.145 --> 38:00.625
That cousin of mine really is suspicious of everyone.

615
38:04.945 --> 38:06.625
Thank you, Your Highness,

616
38:06.705 --> 38:08.345
for telling me the truth about Wei Rao's origins.

617
38:09.305 --> 38:12.225
At least now I won't spend my whole life in ignorance.

618
38:14.745 --> 38:16.665
Turns out she's actually…

619
38:17.385 --> 38:19.225
People are blind and foolish.

620
38:19.825 --> 38:22.145
They often mistake a fish's eye for a pearl.

621
38:23.105 --> 38:26.225
You come from an illustrious family, my dear.

622
38:26.305 --> 38:27.585
Don't torment yourself over this.

623
38:29.465 --> 38:31.305
What good is being a noblewoman?

624
38:32.385 --> 38:35.225
Prince Fu is like that. So is Lu Zhuo.

625
38:35.905 --> 38:36.985
I thought

626
38:37.745 --> 38:39.705
being made to feel inferior to a plain-looking maid

627
38:39.785 --> 38:41.785
was humiliating enough.

628
38:42.785 --> 38:48.425
I never imagined Lu Zhuo's beloved was a night-soil woman.

629
38:52.305 --> 38:53.745
A night-soil woman.

630
38:56.065 --> 38:58.305
I prided myself on my virtue and talent.

631
38:58.985 --> 39:02.465
Yet in the end, I've become someone no one wants.

632
39:03.705 --> 39:05.745
What have all my years of effort

633
39:06.665 --> 39:07.545
amounted to?

634
39:08.905 --> 39:12.305
This world can be so absurd you can only laugh.

635
39:13.185 --> 39:15.105
It's utterly ridiculous.

636
39:17.465 --> 39:21.025
I can't grant your family's request to send Yi Jiang away.

637
39:22.305 --> 39:25.025
Lady Wang personally promised my grandfather

638
39:25.105 --> 39:26.665
that she'd send that maid away.

639
39:27.185 --> 39:28.945
You favor Yi Jiang alone

640
39:29.025 --> 39:31.985
and even had a secondary consort beaten because of her.

641
39:33.105 --> 39:34.825
I hear her face is pockmarked.

642
39:36.065 --> 39:39.625
May I ask, Your Highness, in what way am I inferior to her?

643
39:41.345 --> 39:44.105
Yi Jiang is plain and unremarkable,

644
39:45.065 --> 39:46.825
but she came to my household at seven.

645
39:47.425 --> 39:50.025
When I caught smallpox, she nursed me day and night without rest,

646
39:50.105 --> 39:51.505
and that's why.

647
39:52.185 --> 39:54.025
Now that her youth is fading,

648
39:54.545 --> 39:55.665
I can't abandon her.

649
39:56.745 --> 39:59.905
If you marry into my household, treat her kindly.

650
40:00.425 --> 40:01.305
Don't bully her.

651
40:03.185 --> 40:04.745
You've deeply insulted me, Your Highness.

652
40:05.345 --> 40:06.305
Show him out.

653
40:13.025 --> 40:14.305
I'm ashamed to say this,

654
40:14.905 --> 40:16.545
but Wei Rao was never properly brought up.

655
40:16.625 --> 40:17.545
She has coarse manners

656
40:18.625 --> 40:20.985
and has even openly questioned your virtue.

657
40:21.065 --> 40:22.225
She even said…

658
40:24.265 --> 40:25.105
What did she say?

659
40:26.865 --> 40:30.145
When she heard that a fortune-teller read your face when you were three

660
40:30.225 --> 40:32.025
and foretold a future of unimaginable nobility,

661
40:32.105 --> 40:34.465
she laughed and said…

662
40:36.505 --> 40:39.865
She said, "Girls of noble birth

663
40:40.385 --> 40:42.025
are just voiceless parrots raised in grand mansions,

664
40:42.705 --> 40:44.705
and clay figures and wooden puppets wrapped in silk."

665
40:50.945 --> 40:53.985
Your Highness, no need to provoke me like this.

666
40:55.305 --> 40:57.505
I do have an old score to settle with her.

667
40:57.585 --> 40:59.665
You have your mother's death to avenge too.

668
41:00.265 --> 41:02.585
How do you want me to help you?

669
41:02.665 --> 41:06.825
But let me be clear. Murder, arson, framing people,

670
41:06.905 --> 41:10.785
or anything that disgraces the Xie family is absolutely off the table.

671
41:11.385 --> 41:15.345
You want me to punish Wei Rao for you while you keep your own good name?

672
41:15.425 --> 41:16.465
How greedy you are.

673
41:17.985 --> 41:20.985
Lady Li and her daughter are determined to back Liu Shuo,

674
41:21.065 --> 41:23.025
and they've gained Lu Zhuo's support too.

675
41:24.825 --> 41:27.945
Please put in a good word for the Crown Prince

676
41:28.025 --> 41:29.745
with Grand Tutor Xie.

677
41:30.385 --> 41:31.785
The Grand Tutor is deeply respected.

678
41:31.865 --> 41:34.025
With him holding firm at court,

679
41:34.105 --> 41:35.425
I believe that wicked Lady Li and her daughter

680
41:36.305 --> 41:37.905
won't dare act so arrogantly.

681
41:43.105 --> 41:44.465
HONGXIAN

682
41:45.985 --> 41:47.145
Lost track of Xie Hualou?

683
41:48.065 --> 41:50.945
Perhaps she noticed something and deliberately sent me away.

684
41:51.025 --> 41:52.065
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

685
42:01.265 --> 42:03.345
You're asking why I'm suspicious of Xie Hualou?

686
42:05.585 --> 42:07.385
Xie Hualou and I are different.

687
42:07.465 --> 42:09.185
Her grandfather is a renowned scholar.

688
42:09.905 --> 42:10.945
He taught her

689
42:11.025 --> 42:13.265
loyalty, filial duty and a woman's proper conduct.

690
42:13.985 --> 42:15.145
Plenty of young nobles in the capital

691
42:15.225 --> 42:19.185
keep maids and concubines before marriage and father children out of wedlock.

692
42:19.705 --> 42:21.425
Besides, Prince Fu is the Emperor's son.

693
42:21.505 --> 42:25.145
A royal household full of concubines is nothing unusual to the great families.

694
42:25.825 --> 42:28.105
Yet Xie Hualou is strongly opposed to it.

695
42:29.065 --> 42:34.225
Prince Fu must have some other flaw,

696
42:35.025 --> 42:37.425
one that even a lady like her, so educated and proper,

697
42:37.505 --> 42:39.985
so gentle and virtuous, cannot tolerate.

698
42:48.585 --> 42:50.985
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

699
42:56.225 --> 42:58.025
QIWU COURT

700
42:59.665 --> 43:01.105
Hongxian!

701
43:23.905 --> 43:24.985
The weather's turning.

702
43:25.625 --> 43:27.625
Grandmother's rheumatism will probably worsen.

703
43:28.145 --> 43:29.505
Have the carriage prepared.

704
43:29.585 --> 43:31.265
Head to Earl of Cheng'an's Residence to visit her.

705
43:42.785 --> 43:44.785
I gave her seven days.

706
43:44.865 --> 43:47.945
We'll know her decision soon enough.

707
43:48.025 --> 43:48.865
My Lord.

708
43:48.945 --> 43:51.545
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

709
43:51.625 --> 43:52.985
You're back, My Lord.

710
43:53.585 --> 43:54.985
The Duke just returned from the barracks.

711
43:55.065 --> 43:56.305
He heard how you and General Qi forced your way into the residence

712
43:56.385 --> 43:58.225
and demands you see him in his study at once.

713
44:01.105 --> 44:03.665
-Still no word? -What do you mean, My Lord?

714
44:15.705 --> 44:19.025
What awful weather! Why is it snowing now?

715
44:19.105 --> 44:20.345
Is this a spring cold snap?

716
44:22.225 --> 44:23.305
Something's wrong.

717
44:24.985 --> 44:27.345
Tell Grandfather I'll see him later.

718
44:27.945 --> 44:28.785
My Lord!

719
44:30.225 --> 44:32.385
-My Lord, what am I supposed to say? -Move!

720
44:32.465 --> 44:34.185
-My Lord! -Stop shouting.

721
44:34.825 --> 44:37.025
-A spring cold snap could disrupt farming. -What?

722
44:37.625 --> 44:39.305
Lord Lu is going to see Her Ladyship.

723
44:39.385 --> 44:41.345
He's been waiting for her to give in first.

724
44:41.425 --> 44:42.705
Now that the weather has changed,

725
44:42.785 --> 44:44.225
he's found an excuse to go to her.

726
44:50.065 --> 44:55.385
HENGCHENG GATE

727
44:56.385 --> 44:58.665
Forgive me for speaking out of turn, Your Ladyship.

728
44:58.745 --> 45:01.305
Lady Li dislikes your closeness to the Wei family.

729
45:01.385 --> 45:02.865
You made a trip to Jiming Alley

730
45:02.945 --> 45:05.545
to buy the white rice cakes Old Madam Wei likes.

731
45:05.625 --> 45:08.265
If Lady Li finds out, she'll certainly be upset.

732
45:12.145 --> 45:15.105
You were staring at them earlier, practically drooling.

733
45:15.185 --> 45:16.025
Go on and eat.

734
45:16.705 --> 45:18.505
They're for me?

735
45:19.825 --> 45:21.945
-Have some too, Your Ladyship. -You eat.

736
45:22.025 --> 45:23.065
I bought them for you.

737
45:23.665 --> 45:25.465
We don't have all the rules between us.

738
45:29.385 --> 45:30.665
Whenever Grandmother sees me,

739
45:31.745 --> 45:33.425
it's as if she sees her beloved son,

740
45:34.025 --> 45:35.705
and her condition improves.

741
45:36.545 --> 45:37.905
When I visit her,

742
45:38.745 --> 45:39.905
I'm simply doing

743
45:41.025 --> 45:42.945
a son's duty on behalf of the father I never knew.

744
45:43.905 --> 45:45.825
But if it weren't for Old Madam Wei,

745
45:45.905 --> 45:47.985
-you wouldn't have… -Grandmother loves me

746
45:48.065 --> 45:50.345
because I remind her of the son she loved.

747
45:51.425 --> 45:54.985
She didn't lose me on purpose. It just…

748
45:57.745 --> 45:58.625
the love wasn't enough.

749
46:00.385 --> 46:01.825
But who in this world,

750
46:01.905 --> 46:04.585
would give me a love that's uniquely mine?

751
46:05.825 --> 46:08.865
Not Grandmother. Not Lady Li.

752
46:09.745 --> 46:12.865
If I expect less, I have less to resent.

753
46:15.105 --> 46:17.985
But you should still travel in a manner befitting your rank.

754
46:18.065 --> 46:20.825
Such a plain carriage will make people in the capital laugh at you.

755
46:22.905 --> 46:25.265
When you first came, you were so stern and quiet.

756
46:25.345 --> 46:26.705
You're getting chatty, aren't you?

757
46:38.305 --> 46:41.385
‎SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

758
47:03.665 --> 47:05.865
His Highness, the Crown Prince,

759
47:05.945 --> 47:08.825
will one day ascend the throne, with the whole realm at his feet.

760
47:08.905 --> 47:13.905
Wei Rao, you'll regret today's arrogance when it's too late.

761
47:16.265 --> 47:17.465
If you tell him you won't marry him,

762
47:18.065 --> 47:20.665
Lu Zhuo will give up and marry me.

763
47:44.985 --> 47:47.545
The sun's been swallowed!

764
47:47.625 --> 47:50.385
What's going on?

765
47:51.025 --> 47:53.505
The sun! The sun's been swallowed!

766
47:53.585 --> 47:55.105
The gods are punishing us!

767
47:55.185 --> 47:56.865
Our country is doomed!

768
47:56.945 --> 47:59.025
Run! Something is wrong!

769
47:59.665 --> 48:01.345
The sun is disappearing!

770
48:01.425 --> 48:02.745
The gods are punishing us!

771
48:03.385 --> 48:04.625
The gods are punishing us!

772
48:04.705 --> 48:06.785
-Run! -Run!

773
48:07.745 --> 48:09.745
The gods are punishing us!

774
48:09.825 --> 48:11.145
What's that?

775
48:14.945 --> 48:16.385
Run!

776
48:16.465 --> 48:17.465
Lu Zhuo…

777
48:17.545 --> 48:18.545
My Lady…

778
48:19.985 --> 48:21.825
Stay in the carriage. Don't run off.

779
48:23.545 --> 48:24.865
Your Ladyship, it's dangerous!

780
48:42.265 --> 48:44.505
Yao! Yao!

781
48:44.585 --> 48:46.385
Come!

782
48:56.225 --> 48:57.585
Lu Zhuo!

783
48:59.785 --> 49:00.905
Lu Zhuo!

784
49:04.785 --> 49:05.745
Wei Rao!

785
49:06.825 --> 49:08.065
Hurry!

786
51:21.265 --> 51:24.785
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
